#mucom88 1.7
#title MUCPlayground Demo
#composer MUCOMSX
#comment Edit anything below, then press Play (Ctrl+Enter).

; ---- FM voices, defined inline (no voice file needed) ----
; @n / FB,ALG / then one line per operator:
; AR,D1R,D2R,RR,D1L,TL,KS,ML,DT

; @1 lead: ALG 5, one modulator into three carriers
  @1
   6,5
   31,12,0,7,3,28,0,1,3
   31,6,3,7,3,0,0,1,3
   31,6,3,7,3,0,0,2,7
   31,6,3,7,3,0,0,1,0

; @2 bass: ALG 0, four operators in series
  @2
   5,0
   31,14,0,8,2,30,0,0,0
   31,14,0,8,2,40,0,1,3
   31,12,0,8,2,36,0,1,7
   31,8,4,8,2,0,0,1,0

; ---- Parts ----
; A-C, H-J: FM   D-F: SSG   G: rhythm   L: loop point

A T140 @2 v12 o2 l8 L [aa>a<a]2 [ff>f<f]2 [gg>g<g]2 [ee>e<e]2
B @1 v11 o5 l8 L e4a4ge de c4.de2 f4a4>c4<a4 g4.fe2
B d4g4b4ag f4gab2 >c4<b4a4g4 e1

; SSG parts need a preset (@0) or an envelope (E), or they stay silent
D @0 v9 o4 l16 L [a>cea<]8 [fa>cf<]8 [gb>dg<]8 [egb>e<]8
E @0 v7 o5 l1 L c c c c d d e e

G v60,28,26,22,18,24,24 l8 L [@9c@8c@10c@8c@9c@8c@10c@8c]8
